    "status": "present",
    "value": "parents gives each company at most one direct parent and is acyclic; a company without a parent (including companies absent from parents) is top-level. Map every loan to the top-level ancestor of its company and return one [topCompany, sortedLoanIds] entry per top-level company that has at least one loan, sorted by topCompany ascending. Loan ids are unique."
  },
